.TH "GCM-IMPORT" "1" "11 April,2008" "" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
gcm-import \- GNOME Color Manager Import Tool
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"

\fBgcm-import\fR [ \fB--verbose\fR ]

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
This manual page documents briefly the \fBgcm-import\fR command.
.PP
\fBgcm-import\fR allows you to import ICC files supplied by vendors.
